    "flashless_ram_path": "ProcessFvLoadingForFlashless(RAM_PARTITION_ABL_MEMORY) can mount a preloaded ABL FV from RAM, but only on flashless boot",
    "ufs_abl_path": "with UFS boot and no LoadAutoImageInPILFlag property, LoadAndProcessImages uses PIL ProcessPilImage(ABL_IMAGE); ABL_CFG is fixed ELF_FV raw-partition configuration",
