    "guided_fv_launch": "LaunchAppFromGuidedFv resolves an application inside a mounted guided FV and then uses UEFI LoadImage/StartImage",
    "fastboot_timing": "fastboot implementation is inside already-running LinuxLoader; its download buffer is post-LinuxLoader",
    "fastboot_boot_semantics": "stock fastboot boot consumes an Android boot image, calls LoadImageAndAuth, then BootLinux; it is not UEFI PE chainload",
